# Planning and research artifacts. Local only.
# These held real report content - account numbers and balances - which is
# exactly why they are not in a repo destined to be public.
.wayfinder/

# Never commit reports or report content. This tool's whole job is handling
# real output from real systems, so a fixture is a leak waiting to happen.
# Test data must be fabricated and live under tests/.
*.report.*
perf-report-*
report-*.html
report-*.md
/reports/
/artifacts/

